{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Keep Track 是一款簡潔靈活的記錄工具，適合需要記住服藥、澆水、照顧寵物或處理家務等各種事宜的人。它沒有複雜設定，只需一按即可記錄，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>一按記錄任何事項</h2>\n<p>Keep Track 沒有預設項目或繁複分類，使用者可自行輸入藥物、寵物照顧、運動或家務等項目，之後開啟 App 一按 Log 即可記錄。時間軸會清楚顯示每項事件，方便檢視完成次數與相隔多久，亦可查看歷史紀錄。App 完全離線運作，毋須帳戶，也不追蹤資料，並支援 Face ID 或 Touch ID 上鎖，保障私隱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-288-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-289-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-290-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-291-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-292-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-293-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Keep Track: Life Log</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T04:42:11.404016+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}